      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} It was in a couple updates ago, VRChat prevents joins of an outdated instance if the persistence system is no longer compatible. Some worlds make theirs backwards compatible, and others will not save progress or corrupt on older versions of the world. VRChat did this to prevent non-saved progress and data corruption.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
