      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} Specifically, the change mentioned by @{674163b31461829c27244c08|full_name} was introduced in [VRChat 2025.4.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202541#a-note-about-persistence) (November 3, 2025 - Build 1749).",
