  "details": "When a world rolls out an update that requires people to make a new instance, there are no indicators of the world version when trying to find an instance to join.\n\nCurrent behavior: \n\nAll instances show up and look the same\n\nSuggested behavior:\n\nDisable the buttons for the instances that are out of date (You cant join them anyway)\n\nPlace those outdated instances at the bottom of the list. \n\nAllow people to join the freshly created instances!",
